Completed Registry Wave visual round 3 while preserving existing uncommitted work.

- Fixed Executive Signal placement: xl body copy is hidden in both themes; rail is explicitly `executive-signal--rail` and stacked.
- Matched light rail author-card density: 38px avatar, 18px single-line name, 12px bio, inline links.
- Made Registry Wave light surfaces coherent with dark geometry using `#FFFFFF` / `#F7F8FB`, `#E3E8F0` hairlines, and unchanged violet accent. Applied matching treatment to section markers, pull quotes, and reading-path cards.
- Harness now removes both theme classes before applying the requested one and uses `s2s-theme`.

DOM checks:

- 1440x900, both themes: article 692px, rail 266px, rail signal 245x316px stacked, body signal `display:none`; marker grid `4px 40px 682px`.
